{'symbol': 'AEP', 'date': '2022-07-26 12:37:00', 'title': "AEP RECOGNIZED AS ONE OF AMERICA'S BEST EMPLOYERS FOR WOMEN", 'text': "COLUMBUS, OHIO , JULY 26, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --AMERICAN ELECTRIC POWER (NASDAQ: AEP) WAS INCLUDED IN FORBES MAGAZINE'S AMERICA'S BEST EMPLOYERS FOR WOMEN 2022\xa0LIST FOR THE THIRD CONSECUTIVE YEAR. THE LIST WAS COMPILED BASED ON AN INDEPENDENT SURVEY OF 50,000 U.S. EMPLOYEES, INCLUDING 30,000 WOMEN, WORKING FOR COMPANIES WITH AT LEAST 1,000 EMPLOYEES."}